     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="32" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>32</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tu devrais pas être à l&apos;école ?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>when talking to 1 of the franks without having enough reputation</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="33" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>33</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Parce que y a que les gosses qu&apos;ont que *45 points de REP*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="34" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>34</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tu me défies ?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>when talking to 1 of the franks having enough reputation</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="35" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>35</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Essaie d&apos;obtenir un *multiplicateur x8* en te *penchant vers l&apos;intérieur* avant les virages sur cette ligne.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="36" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>36</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Compris ? *Penche-toi dans la direction d&apos;un virage juste avant de l&apos;atteindre* en maintenant la commande gauche ou droite.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="37" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>37</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>... Tu crois vraiment que tu peux y arriver, hein...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>retry</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="38" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>38</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Penche-toi dans les virages en *maintenant les commandes gauche ou droite* pour obtenir un *multiplicateur x8*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="39" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>39</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>OK, t&apos;es pas complètement naze...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>success</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="40" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>40</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tu veux vraiment abandonner ?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Question, when talking to 1 of the franks while doing their challenge</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="41" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>41</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hors de mon chemin, alors.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="42" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>42</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>OK. OK. C&apos;est comme ça que je fais pour me pencher dans les virages en *maintenant les commandes gauche ou droite*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="43" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>43</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>On dirait bien que la police du fun est en route. C&apos;est-à-dire la police, tout court.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>the franks, when the police show up. Doesn’t need a joke per se, just some smooth talk</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="44" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>44</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ça fait un bout de temps qu&apos;ils nous collent, donc on va se tirer.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="45" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>45</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Si jamais tu survis, sache que nous, les FRANKS, on a *70 points de REP*. </text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="46" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>46</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tu veux de nouveau nous défier ? Alors, reviens quand t&apos;auras au moins autant de REP que nous.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="47" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>47</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Arrêtez tous les vandales !</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>the police</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="48" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>48</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tu veux entrer dans notre planque? Je crois pas, non...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>frank guarding the barricade to their hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="49" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>49</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>T&apos;as pas *70 points de REP*, alors je te parle pas.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="50" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>50</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mais regardez qui voilà ! Tryce et son crew.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>prince talking</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="51" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>51</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>On m&apos;appelle le *Flesh Prince*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="52" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>52</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Bienvenue dans mon royaume.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="53" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>53</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Fais pas attention à mes gars. Faut bien qu&apos;ils s&apos;amusent un peu.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="54" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>54</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Prince est un prodige de tout ce qui touche à la viande et au métal.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="55" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>55</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>C&apos;est lui qui a créé tous ces mecs.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="56" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>56</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Y a pas meilleur que moi.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>prince talking</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="57" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>57</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Quand quelqu&apos;un perd un bras, c&apos;est moi qu&apos;il vient voir...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="58" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>58</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ou, dans des cas plus rares...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="59" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>59</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Quand quelqu&apos;un perd la *tête*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="60" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>60</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
