     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Il faut faire régner l&apos;ORDRE, et moi, DJ Cyber, *en tant que l&apos;un des Big 3*, je peux dire que mon crew FUTURISM en est parfaitement capable. </text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="169" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>169</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>... Alors, comme ça, tu veux récupérer ta tête. Laisse-moi te regarder un peu. </text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="170" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>170</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tu sais... Depuis qu&apos;on a des *robots pour rêver*, la cybernétique a fait un bond de géant.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
