    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="176" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>176</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>pyramid</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tryce... Bel... Qu&apos;est-ce qui se passe ?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>red</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="177" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>177</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>pyramid</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>On s&apos;est fait avoir, Red. Vinyl était dans le coup depuis le début.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="178" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>178</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>pyramid</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Vinyl et DJ essayaient de te *rendre ton identité*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="179" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>179</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>pyramid</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Qui aurait cru que notre pote Red était en fait *Félix*, le légendaire graffeur ?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="180" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>180</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>pyramid</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DJ et moi, on savait que t&apos;étais *Félix*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>vinyl</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="181" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>181</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>pyramid</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>On a décidé de te pousser à franchir le dernier pas pour que tu puisses voir par toi-même.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="182" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>182</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>pyramid</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Je suis désolée, mais *on n&apos;a plus le temps*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="183" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>183</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>pyramid</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Je sais que c&apos;est abusé de ma part de vous demander de me faire confiance.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>dj</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="184" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>184</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>pyramid</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mais je vous promets... que j&apos;arrêterai d&apos;utiliser ces *disques de métal*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
