    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="265" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>265</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Avant, j&apos;étais le roi de Mataan. J&apos;étais là quand tout a commencé !</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="266" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>266</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hmmm. À l&apos;époque, y avait genre 5 immeubles en tout, mais j&apos;avais graffé mon nom sur chacun d&apos;entre eux !</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="267" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>267</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Avant ça, je vivais à *Old Amsterdam*, et je peux te dire qu&apos;entre ici et là-bas, c&apos;est le jour et la nuit.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="268" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>268</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tu sais ce que c&apos;est un *arbre*, le jeune ?! Y en avait des tonnes !</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="269" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>269</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Des vrais arbres, des *fournisseurs naturels d&apos;oxygène* !</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="270" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>270</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Si tu veux mon avis, on devrait en remettre un peu partout.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1021"/>
    </table:table-row>
