     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Je vois que t&apos;as pas chômé et que tu t&apos;es construit une belle petite réputation !</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>oldhead enough rep</text:p>
