      <text:p>279</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Dans la *vieille ville*, y avait un quartier qui ressemblait à ça.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
