     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce64" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Voulez-vous changer pour un *skate* ?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>in the hideout for switching movestyle, also takes you to the menu to switch colors on your skateboard/skates/bmx</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1020"/>
    </table:table-row>
