     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>O03</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Gagnez de la REP en faisant des graffitis et défiez les FRANKS pour obtenir des informations sur DJ Cyber.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>REP is an ingame mechanic reflected in the UI and dialogue. Stands for reputation. Preferably untranslated</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>O04</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Trouvez un moyen de vous réveiller.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>O05</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Rejoignez Millennium Square pour défier ECLIPSE.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>O06</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Gagnez de la REP et défiez ECLIPSE sur son propre territoire.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>O07</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Allez jusqu&apos;au bout du rêve.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>O08</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Entrez dans le Millennium Mall et battez DOT EXE.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
